                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela wakabika baangelo abakerebimu mucikombelo camukati. Lino nibakatandabika mababa aabo, ibbaba lyakerebimu umwi lyakaguma kubulambo, abbaba lyakerebimunyina alyalo lyakaguma kubulambo bwabili, alimwi akati kaŋanda mababa aabo akali kugumana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
