          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elyo mumwaka wakumi aumwi, mumwezi wa-Buli (nkukuti mwezi wamusanu aitatu) iŋanda yakamana kuyakwa kumabazu oonse mbubonya mbuyakayeeyegwa. Aboobo kuyakwa kwayo kwakatola myaka iili musanu aibili.",
